        "table": null,
        "text": "•Consolidated Alphabet revenues increased 18%, or 17% in constant currency, to $113.8 billion, reflecting strong momentum across the business and acceleration in growth in both Google Services and Google Cloud.",
        "text_hash": "4ad165a45d6e8e73875abf5720917866c6bf50b409789d51b48221651819547a",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
